    "Id": "mechdef_orion_iic_ON1-IIC-Z",
    "Name": "Orion IIC Z",
    "Details": "The Orion IIC-Z is a Society refit of the venerable Orion IIC, though whether its creation was intended to honor Aleksandr Kerensky or simply spit in the face of Clan Wolf remains unclear. Beneath its familiar silhouette, however, little remains traditional. A Society HVAC/20 provides the 'Mech's primary direct-fire punch, while a massive MRM-60 with Apollo fire control and a selection of specialized munitions gives the IIC-Z considerable flexibility against a wide variety of targets. Twin Medium Supra Lasers provide reliable secondary firepower without drawing upon its ammunition reserves. Clan Ferro-Lamellor armor greatly improves the Orion's already considerable durability, while Nova CEWS integrates the machine into the Society's networked battlefield doctrine. Finally, a Society Interface Cockpit replaces the conventional control systems, turning one of the Clans' most historically significant BattleMechs into something unmistakably their own.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Lower, Right Lower</color>",
    "Icon": "uixTxrIcon_orioniic"
  },
